  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>DecorationWarningNDD</name>
    <id>107</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/>  For a more accurate condition for recognizing expenses, use the FIFO goods cost estimation method
</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/>  برای شرط دقیق‌تر شناسایی هزینه‌ها، از روش برآورد بهای کالای FIFO استفاده کنید
</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/>  Для более точного условия признания расходов  требуется использовать метод оценки стоимости товаров &quot;ФИФО&quot;
</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/>  Giderlerin muhasebeleştirilmesinin daha doğru koşulu için &quot;FIFO&quot; stok değerleme yönteminin kullanılması gerekmektedir
</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/>  Để làm rõ hơn điều kiện xác nhận chi phí, cần sử dụng phương thức đánh giá giá trị hàng hóa &quot;FIFO&quot;
</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/>  For a more accurate condition for recognizing expenses, use the FIFO goods cost estimation method
</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/>  For a more accurate condition for recognizing expenses, use the FIFO goods cost estimation method
